<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Product Pairing</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .body-text { font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; }
        .image-container { text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }
        .diagram-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; margin: 40px 0; }
        .feature-list { list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt; }
        .feature-list li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; }
        .note { font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 20px; color: #555; }
        .dimension-table th, .dimension-table td { padding: 5px; font-size: 9pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div>
            <div class="header-title">ABB PRODUCT PAIRING</div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 28pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;">ABB servo motors and drives</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Sustainable solution and matched performance</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="ABB Logo" style="width: 150px;">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="servo_motor_drive_image.png" alt="Servo Motor and Drive" style="max-width: 80%;">
    </div>

    <div class="body-text" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <p>ABB's BSM B-series servo motors provide medium inertia. Achieve even higher efficiencies by pairing them with ACS880 drives and advanced motor controls.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">ABB solution:</h3>
            <p>Combine ABB servo motors and drives for optimal performance.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diagram-container">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="icon_motor.png" alt="Motor Icon" style="width: 80px;">
            <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Motor features:</p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Sustainable ferrite non-rare earth magnet material</li>
                <li>Higher rotor inertia – for matching heavier machine inertial loads</li>
                <li>Optional forced air cooling – to extend torque capability for additional motor performance</li>
                <li>Rugged design for rugged environments – quality in the design</li>
                <li>Windings potted for additional voltage protection and improved heat transfer</li>
                <li>cURus/CE certified quality designs</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="icon_plus.png" alt="Plus Icon" style="width: 40px;">
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="icon_drive.png" alt="Drive Icon" style="width: 80px;">
            <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Drive features:</p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Direct torque control (DTC) for precise speed and torque control</li>
                <li>Support for various motor types</li>
                <li>Extensive selection of drives, including regenerative and ultra-low harmonic variants</li>
                <li>Global product approvals, e.g. CE, UL, cUL, CSA, marine certifications, ATEX</li>
                <li>Worldwide service and support</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">BSM B-Series + ACS880</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Matched solution for demanding applications ranging from simple standalone (single-axis) to complex networks (multi-axis).</p>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="servo_motor_drive_assembly.png" alt="Servo Motor and Drive Assembly" style="max-width: 90%;">
    </div>

    <p class="note">Note: ACS880-01 drives can be ordered with +NS700 positioning control programs for simple positioning systems.</p>

    <h3 class="section-heading">ACS880 parameter</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>ACS880 parameter number</th>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th>BSM80B-133</th>
                <th>Example: BSM80B-133 value</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>99.03</td>
                <td>Motor type</td>
                <td>Asynchronous Induction=0</td>
                <td>1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.04</td>
                <td>Synchronous PM=1</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.06</td>
                <td>Motor nom. current</td>
                <td>DTC=0</td>
                <td>4.6 (1)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.07</td>
                <td>Motor nom. voltage</td>
                <td>Scalar=1</td>
                <td>84 (2)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.08</td>
                <td>Motor nom. frequency</td>
                <td>V/Hz</td>
                <td>133.3 (3)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.09</td>
                <td>Motor nom. speed</td>
                <td>RPM</td>
                <td>4000 (4)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.10</td>
                <td>Motor nom. power</td>
                <td>kW</td>
                <td>0.57 (5)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>99.13</td>
                <td>ID run request</td>
                <td>Yes=1</td>
                <td>1</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="note">*ID run must be performed every time any of the motor parameters (99.04, 99.06, 99.12) have been changed.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Matched performance selection guide</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">BSM B-series and ACS880 (wall-mounted single drives)</p>

    <h3 class="section-heading">Drive catalog number example: ACS880-01-0646-2</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Cont. stall torque (Nm)</th>
                <th>Current (A)</th>
                <th>Power (kW)</th>
                <th>BEMF (V)</th>
                <th>Speed (RPM)</th>
                <th>Servo catalog number</th>
                <th>ACS880-01-XXXX</th>
                <th>w/j-box</th>
                <th>w/connector</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for row in performance_data %}
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].stall_torque">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].stall_torque }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].current">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].current }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].power">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].power }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].bemf">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].bemf }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].speed">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].speed }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].servo_catalog_number">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].servo_catalog_number }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].acs880_number">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].acs880_number }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].with_jbox">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].with_jbox }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="performance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].with_connector">{{ performance_data[loop.index0].with_connector }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">BSM B-series dimensions</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">IEC mounting</p>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; margin: 40px 0;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="bsm_80_series_diagram.png" alt="BSM 80 Series Diagram" style="max-width: 30%;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Rotatable connector</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="bsm_90_100_series_diagram.png" alt="BSM 90/100 Series Diagram" style="max-width: 30%;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Metric style connector</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <img src="bsm_90_100_series_diagram_detail.png" alt="BSM 90/100 Series Detail" style="max-width: 30%;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Rotatable terminal box & metric style connector</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="section-heading">BSM 80 series</h3>
    <table class="dimension-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Motor code</th>
                <th>L</th>
                <th>P</th>
                <th>A</th>
                <th>U</th>
                <th>AH</th>
                <th>KEY</th>
                <th>2J</th>
                <th>3J</th>
                <th>AK</th>
                <th>BB</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for row in bsm_80_data %}
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].motor_code">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].motor_code }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].l">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].l }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].p">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].p }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].a">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].a }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].u">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].u }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ah">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].ah }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].key">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].key }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].j2">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].j2 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].j3">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].j3 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ak">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].ak }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_80_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].bb">{{ bsm_80_data[loop.index0].bb }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3 class="section-heading">BSM 90/100 series</h3>
    <table class="dimension-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Motor code</th>
                <th>L</th>
                <th>P</th>
                <th>A</th>
                <th>U</th>
                <th>AH</th>
                <th>KEY</th>
                <th>2J</th>
                <th>3J</th>
                <th>AK</th>
                <th>BB</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for row in bsm_90_100_data %}
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].motor_code">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].motor_code }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].l">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].l }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].p">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].p }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].a">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].a }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].u">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].u }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ah">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].ah }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].key">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].key }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].j2">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].j2 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].j3">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].j3 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ak">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].ak }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="bsm_90_100_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].bb">{{ bsm_90_100_data[loop.index0].bb }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p class="note">Dimensions in inch (mm)</p>
    <p class="note">ABB Motors and Mechanical Inc. 3711 S. R. Boreham, MA 01721. For more information, visit <a href="#">www.abb.com/motors-generators</a></p>
</div>

</body>
</html>